Hello everyone,

The Cultural Club is inaugurating its 2026-27 council and we would love
for you to join us. It will be a relaxed evening with a few short
performances.

  Date: Friday, 16 October 2026
  Time: 16:00-17:30 IST
  Venue: Main Auditorium

Programme:
- Welcome note by the club secretary
- Address by our faculty advisor, Prof. Rohan Iyer
- Introduction of the new council members
- Student performances: classical dance, a short skit and a band set

Refreshments will be served at the foyer after the programme. Please
accept the attached calendar invitation so we can estimate the turnout.

Best,
Kavya Subramanian
Secretary, Cultural Club
--=_TW_ALT_ec03dda768e96102
